gsnaugdesign:dd-0011
    a gsndesign:RetiredDecision ;
    gsndesign:retirementReason """Reversed at 0.2.0. gsnaug:raisedAgainst now carries a six-way range union, and gsnaugsh:IssueShape rejects a target outside it. The reasoning against a range still holds for a narrow one; what changed is that a union covering everything in a case is not narrow, and a shape closes the gap a generative range leaves open."""@en ;
    gsndesign:supersededBy gsnaugdesign:dd-0040 ;
    gsndesign:formalism gsndesign:OWL ;
    gsndesign:naturalLanguage "An issue may be raised against anything in a case, so the property that says what it is about declares no range."@en ;
    prov:used gsnaugdesign:src-0002 ;
    gsndesign:hasRationale gsnaugdesign:why-0009 ;
    prov:generated gsnaugdesign:st-0011 .

