    gsndesign:aboutTerm gsnaug:ReviseIssueChallengesSolution ;
    gsndesign:mentionsTerm gsnaug:ResolveIssueDefeatsSolution , gsnaug:ReviseIssueChallengesSolution .

gsnaugdesign:dd-0024
    a gsndesign:RetiredDecision ;
    gsndesign:retirementReason """Withdrawn at 0.2.0 with the classes the rules read. Deriving the system through gsn:refersTo also typed it a gsn:Artefact, which naming the far end fixes."""@en ;
    gsndesign:supersededBy gsnaugdesign:dd-0041 ;
    gsndesign:formalism gsndesign:SWRL ;
    gsndesign:naturalLanguage "The system and the requirement are derived from the two top-level contexts, so that a case which draws them does not have to assert them twice."@en ;
    prov:used gsnaugdesign:src-0008 ;
    gsndesign:hasRationale gsnaugdesign:why-0013 ;
    prov:generated gsnaugdesign:st-0024 .

