    gsndesign:mentionsTerm gsnaug:generatedBy , gsnaug:generatedWith , gsnaug:retrievableWith , gsnaug:storedIn , gsnaug:verifiedWith .

gsnaugdesign:dd-0027
    a gsndesign:DesignDecision ;
